---
// Dark only, like pglite.dev (VitePress `appearance: 'force-dark'`). Starlight's ThemeSelect,
// which reads StarlightThemeProvider, is overridden with an empty component.
---

<script is:inline>
  document.documentElement.dataset.theme = 'dark'
  window.StarlightThemeProvider = { updatePickers() {} }
</script>
